<section
  class="w-full bg-gray-50 lg:py-14 py-20 md:py-24 xl:py-16"
  aria-label="Cita de Bill Gates sobre la importancia de la presencia digital de los negocios"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <figure class="text-center">
      <svg
        class="w-10 h-10 mx-auto text-indigo-600 mb-1 opacity-75"
        fill="currentColor"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path
          fill="currentColor"
          d="M3.516 7a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-3.5 3.5L0 10a7 7 0 0 1 7-7v2a4.97 4.97 0 0 0-3.536 1.464a5 5 0 0 0-.497.578q.269-.043.548-.043zm9 0a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-3.5 3.5L9 10a7 7 0 0 1 7-7v2a4.97 4.97 0 0 0-3.536 1.464a5 5 0 0 0-.497.578q.269-.043.549-.043z"
        ></path>
      </svg>

      <blockquote
        class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light italic text-indigo-950 leading-relaxed"
        cite="https://www.linkedin.com/in/billgates/"
      >
        <p>
          "Si tu negocio <strong>no está en Internet</strong>, tu negocio <strong
            >no existe</strong
          >."
        </p>
      </blockquote>

      <figcaption class="mt-6 text-base font-medium text-indigo-950/80">
        &mdash;
        <cite class="not-italic font-heading">
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/williamhgates/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
          >
            Bill Gates
          </a>
        </cite>, Co-fundador de Microsoft
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
